@page "/"

<PageTitle>SeatSync</PageTitle>

<h1>SeatSync Event Management Platform</h1>

<p>
    SeatSync is an event management platform for organizers and admins to publish events and for attendees to
    reserve seats with transactional booking guarantees.
</p>

<h2>What you can do</h2>
<ul>
    <li>Browse upcoming events and select seats.</li>
    <li>Create secure seat holds and finalize orders.</li>
    <li>Run mock payments and generate downloadable booking receipts.</li>
    <li>Email receipts through the built-in mock email endpoint.</li>
</ul>

<h2>Demo accounts</h2>
<ul>
    <li><strong>Admin:</strong> <code>admin@seatsync.demo</code> / <code>demo123</code></li>
    <li><strong>Organizer:</strong> <code>organizer@seatsync.demo</code> / <code>demo123</code></li>
    <li><strong>Attendee:</strong> <code>attendee@seatsync.demo</code> / <code>demo123</code></li>
</ul>

<p>
    Start with <a href="/login">Login</a> and then open <a href="/seating">Seat Booking</a>.
</p>
